cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator in published work, please cite it. It is a research and teaching tool and has not been validated against experimental data; see the README for its limitations."
title: "Celeritas: Cherenkov Spectrometry Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Kivitas"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-06-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kivitas/celeritas"
license: MIT
abstract: "Analytic Frank-Tamm Cherenkov photon-yield model with Sellmeier dispersion and a simple slab transport model, with a browser interface for exploring kinematics and detector settings. Not a Monte Carlo and not for clinical or dosimetric use."
keywords:
  - Cherenkov radiation
  - Frank-Tamm formula
  - Sellmeier dispersion
  - Scientific computing
